## 5. Full shower release/HOLD/dwell cycle — No Action Required

Confirmed end-to-end on device (`orcon4.log` 11:26–11:30): BOOST → release →
HOLD 300 s → `hold_expired` → IDLE. Matches
`test_shower_detection_fires_and_clears` and
`test_boost_min_dwell_blocks_early_release`. No code change. Update
`ARCHITECTURE.md:231` / `BUGFIX.md` status so this is not re-verified later.

