## Cross-cutting

**Documentation.** `ARCHITECTURE.md` needs edits for items 1 (FAULT/MANUAL
precedence and `Problem` semantics — lines 82, 143, 172), 2 (boot sequence),
3 (tuning table, line 212), and 222/231 (open-defect and verification pointers).
`CHANGELOG.md` gets a v2.0.1 section for items 1–3. Keep documentation edits in
the same commit as the change they describe.

**Verification gate.** `make -C test` must pass before and after every commit.
No task in this plan is allowed to leave the host suite red.
